  m_Name: Torn Diary Page
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  HoverText: Torn Diary Page
  ContentText: 'I don''t think this is just a simple accident..Those who returned
    from dispatch 2 weeks ago have been showing symptoms of some sort of poisoning.
    It doesn''t help that the contamination hasn''t been contained either. I feel
    it slowly seeping into the codex already but maybe im just being paranoid.


    Had
    Ras not gone missing, maybe He would''ve found a solution. '
